{
    "background_story": "Malakai was born with a rare congenital defect called exomphalos, where his intestines were outside of his body. Despite the initial shock and uncertainty, his parents were determined to give him the best possible life. After multiple surgeries and a long recovery, Malakai defied the odds and grew into a bright and curious child. His experience had a profound impact on his family, teaching them the value of resilience and compassion. As Malakai grew older, he became an advocate for children with rare medical conditions, using his platform to raise awareness and support for families navigating similar challenges. His courage and determination inspired countless people, and he proved that even the most unexpected beginnings can lead to a life of purpose and joy.",
